<p class="Use"><span class="Command">Create Polyline (Manual)</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>useful</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">for extracting feature line or edge information from any point data.&#160;</span></p>
